            "activity_name": "U5: Implement Read-Permission Invoke for Queries",
            "activity_description": "Modify the transaction validation logic to inspect chaincode operations. Implement policy that allows `Get`-only transactions with Reader permission. Add a `ReadOnlyInvoke` path if operation-level inspection is too complex. Develop comprehensive tests for both permission cases.",
